      </p>
      <h3>Overlapping Working Hours</h3>
      <p>
        Standard business hours in Pago Pago (8:00 AM to 5:00 PM SST) correspond to <strong>2:00 PM to 11:00 PM EST</strong>. The most effective overlap window occurs between <strong>8:00 AM and 11:00 AM SST (2:00 PM to 5:00 PM EST)</strong>, giving teams 3 hours of shared office availability daily.
      </p>
      <h3>Technical Systems Context</h3>
      <p>
        Cloud servers, distributed APIs, and maritime logistics systems operating across Pacific territories frequently translate UTC or SST timestamps to EST for U.S. corporate reporting. Using a date-aware calculation ensures accurate log parsing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Common Mistakes -->
